      "content": "That's a good start, thanks. It's definitely clearer than the raw text. \n\nOne thing though—I just ran your response through our preliminary check, and the coverage score came back a bit low. The partners are pretty strict about ensuring the \"claim terms\" are explicitly represented so the system doesn't flag the summary as \"incomplete.\" \n\nCan you try a second version? I still really need it to be readable for the client, but try to make sure you've incorporated the specific technical terminology from the claims more robustly so the score is higher. Just don't make it a total mess of jargon, okay?",
      "source": "evaluator"
